WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.435
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.803
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well,

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.304
and if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:08.774
While touring the demilitarized
zone on Thursday,

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:11.077
Vice President Kamala Harris
mistakenly said

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.046
the U.S. has, quote,
"an alliance

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:15.381
with the Republic
of North Korea."

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:18.751
It's a huge blunder that many
are calling presidential.

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:21.721
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.959
Supreme Court Justice
Clarence Thomas's wife Ginni

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:28.661
testified on Thursday before the
house committee investigating

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:31.898
the Capitol attack in
a four-hour closed-door session,

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:34.300
and no matter how much
the committee begged her,

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.703
she would not open the door.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.204
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.973
The National Archives said last
week they still did not have

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:42.541
custody of all missing records

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:44.310
from former President Trump's
administration.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.080
And this is absolutely
the first time Donald Trump

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.315
has ever fought someone
for custody.

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:52.118
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.520
[As Trump] It's all yours.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:57.290
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:58.858
[Normally] According
to newly-released documents,

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.193
the FBI spent years
surveilling the late singer

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:03.563
Aretha Franklin, which isn't
surprising if you've seen

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:06.533
and of her performances
from the '60s.

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:09.602
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.309
So I guess that's an FBI agent.

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:18.111
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:20.079
Ordering from a giant menu.

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:23.116
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.919 --> 00:01:29.055
The FBI used to dress like
"Inspector Gadget."

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:32.091
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:34.527
When he was preparing to leave
Walter Reed Medical Center

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.829
in 2020 after being treated
for the coronavirus,

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:39.832
then-President Trump reportedly
told aides he wanted to exit

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:43.036
the hospital in a wheelchair
and then stand up to reveal

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:47.473
a Superman shirt, you know, just
like Superman would never do.

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:51.076
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.076 --> 00:01:53.679
A little league baseball card of
Facebook founder Mark Zuckerberg

00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:55.114
sold an auction last week,

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:57.617
and even then, they knew he
wasn't going to be an athlete.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:01.353
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.353 --> 00:02:05.725
The New York sandwich shop
Katz's Delicatessen in Alidoro

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:08.795
announced the release of a
New York subway-themed sandwich.

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:11.831
The way it works is you eat
the sandwich while a stranger

00:02:11.831 --> 00:02:13.166
masturbates next to you.

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:16.136
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:22.641
Yes.

00:02:22.641 --> 00:02:24.210
That's right.
Katz's will release

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:27.447
the so-called 1904 Signature Sub
this month

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:30.216
in honor of the subway system's
118th birthday.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:32.151
And if you're wondering what
the subway was like

00:02:32.151 --> 00:02:33.686
118 years ago,

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:34.687
ride it.

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:37.723
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.027
Disney World fully reopened
to its normal hours

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:42.695
over the weekend
after Hurricane Ian,

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:43.996
and it's pretty much the same,

00:02:43.996 --> 00:02:46.966
except now, the whole place
smells like wet Goofy.

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:49.836
[ Audience groans, laughs ]

00:02:53.238 --> 00:02:55.875
Oh, you're all on board for
the subway masturbator.

00:02:57.376 --> 00:02:59.412
We draw the line at wet Goofy.

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:02.848
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.848 --> 00:03:05.618
And finally, Chipotle is set
next month to begin testing

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:08.354
its new kitchen robot
named Chippy.

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.723
And to give you the authentic
Chipotle experience,

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:12.859
the robot will be high as hell.

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:14.928
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.435
[Robot voice]
"What did you say again?"

00:03:22.435 --> 00:03:25.338
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:29.409
Ha ha ha ha.

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:30.509
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.509 --> 00:03:32.078
[Normally] That was a monologue,
everybody.

